---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const beta = 'https://gobk-checkup-beta.jimmydanol.chatgpt.site/v2?v=35ae797';
const frameScript = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}checkup-beta-v2-frame.js`;
---
<Base title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta V2)" description="An eleven-question bankruptcy checkup that follows the attached guide from marriage and prior bankruptcy through household, property and debt questions.">
  <section class="section beta-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="beta-heading"><h1>Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta V2)</h1><a href={beta} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open full screen ↗</a></div>
      <p class="lede">The eleven guide questions begin with marriage and prior bankruptcy, then cover household size, gross household income, a home, a vehicle, other significant assets, taxes, child support or alimony, student loans and unsecured debt. Income regularity and goal prompts are clearly labeled added follow-ups. The interactive lab separately exposes urgency and payment pressure as unnumbered graph context.</p>
      <iframe data-gobk-checkup-beta-v2 src={beta} height="2400" title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta V2) eleven-question structured questionnaire" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
      <nav class="beta-links" aria-label="Checkup versions and workflow"><a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta">Open the original beta</a><a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow">See the workflow</a><a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow-interactive">Explore the interactive workflow</a></nav>
      <details class="beta-about"><summary>About this beta</summary>
        <p>Your eleven guide answers and the clearly labeled added follow-ups go to the hosted Checkup and through the same fixed LangGraph steps. Income regularity follows the gross-income question; goal prompts appear with the home, vehicle or unsecured-debt question. Ordinary TypeScript applies the same branches to the same answers. No language model chooses the result.</p>
        <p>The gross-income range is context, not a means test. Home or vehicle equity answers do not calculate exemptions or decide what property is protected. An earlier filing answer does not calculate a waiting period.</p>
        <p>After the result, V2 selects up to three videos from the topics you chose. The videos do not change the graph result. Google receives a request only when you play or open one.</p>
        <p>No name, email, phone number, account number, document upload or saved assessment is needed. The Checkup does not decide whether to file, chapter eligibility, property protection or debt discharge.</p>
        <p>Individuals may represent themselves; the <a href="https://www.uscourts.gov/court-programs/bankruptcy/filing-without-attorney" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. Courts recommends qualified legal help</a>. <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/how-do-i-find-an-attorney-in-my-state-en-1549/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find legal help</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<script is:inline src={frameScript}></script>
<style>
  .beta-section { padding-top: var(--space-4); }
  .beta-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .beta-heading a, .beta-links, .beta-about { font-size: .9rem; }
  .lede { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; border: 0; background: transparent; }
  .beta-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1.5rem; margin-block: 1rem; }
  .beta-about { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: .75rem; }
  .beta-about summary { cursor: pointer; }
  .beta-about p { margin-block: .75rem; }
</style>
